      "description": "<p data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"757\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong data-start=\"681\" data-end=\"757\">Bob Seger &amp; The Silver Bullet Band – Still The Same / Feel Like A Number</strong><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"890\">Original 1978 Capitol Records 7-inch 45 RPM single featuring two classic tracks from the multi-platinum album <strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"889\">Stranger in Town</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"1003\">A great addition for fans of classic rock, Bob Seger collectors, jukebox owners, and vintage vinyl enthusiasts.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1008\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1dr5t50\" data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1021\">Details</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1225\">\n<li data-section-id=\"vdjonp\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1067\">\nArtist: Bob Seger &amp; The Silver Bullet Band\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"bqmp9b\" data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1091\">\nTitle: Still The Same\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"181rfd1\" data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1120\">\nB-Side: Feel Like A Number\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jsep0m\" data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1145\">\nLabel: Capitol Records\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"35lmne\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1168\">\nCatalog Number: 4581\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"mn8imy\" data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1194\">\nFormat: 7\" Vinyl Single\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"r3wzuj\" data-start=\"1195\" data-end=\"1210\">\nSpeed: 45 RPM\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10vwi65\" data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1225\">\nCountry: USA\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1230\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"17si63v\" data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1249\">Track Listing</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1261\"><strong data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1261\">Side A</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1285\">\n<li data-section-id=\"18g282k\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1285\">\nStill The Same – 3:21\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1297\"><strong data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1297\">Side B</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1325\">\n<li data-section-id=\"fx3qvr\" data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1325\">\nFeel Like A Number – 3:42\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1330\">\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hrykuu\" data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1344\">Condition</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1360\"><strong data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1357\">Record:</strong> VG</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1502\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1xbo8vn\" data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1432\">\nRetains a nice shine with visible light scratches and handling marks.\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"sze3gu\" data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1463\">\nNo cracks or chips observed.\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"aj2v6h\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1502\">\nLabels are clean and fully readable.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1515\"><strong data-start=\"1504\" data-end=\"1515\">Sleeve:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1588\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1613scd\" data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1588\">\nShips in a new white paper sleeve with a protective poly outer sleeve.\n</li>\n</ul>",
